          {
            "text": "PUBLICAR A",
            "url": "https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Juan%20Carlos%20I%20presenta%20sus%20memorias%20%C2%ABReconciliaci%C3%B3n%C2%BB%20como%20un%20%C2%AB%C3%BAltimo%20legado%C2%BB%20a%20los%20espa%C3%B1oles%20al%20recibir%20en%20Francia%20el%20Premio%20Saint-Simon.%20El%20rey%20em%C3%A9rito%20afirma%20que%20escribirlas%20fue%20%C2%ABm%C3%A1s%20temerario%20que%20prudente%C2%BB.%20Juan%20Carlos%20I%20se%20estrena%20como%20%C2%ABrey%20memorialista%C2%BB."
